{"name":"바스티온","description":"끔찍했던 옴닉 사태의 최전선에 있던 이 호기심 많은 바스티온은 아름다운 자연에 매료되어, 냉혹한 인류를 두려워하면서도 세계를 탐험합니다.","backgrounds":[{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blte23b91958a7479bf/631a8b92251b540e0aea78ac/960_Bastion.jpg","sizes":["min","xs","sm"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltcd0d5eb4b44d35f1/631a8b92e7bdcf0dd996c8e5/1600_Bastion.jpg","sizes":["md","lg"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltac77c0e793cedb9d/631a8b923ab6f40dd2a906b1/2600_Bastion.jpg","sizes":["xl+"]}],"portrait":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/4ede795c2a681aaccfa72d0c901cba0cb8a2c292fd6a97b2ba9faed161c2d184.png","role":"damage","subrole":"specialist","location":"스웨덴, 예테보리","birthday":"Unknown","age":32,"hitpoints":{"shields":0,"health":250,"armor":100,"total":350},"abilities":[{"name":"설정: 강습","description":"느리게 이동하며 강력한 기관포를 발사합니다.","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/c3391c7eb4ce0ac2483d1821299fa684072e2ace043ac6ae7839f81f09c187f9.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt8cd68d463a5bf298/6333a53b2dc7636608cc706a/BASTION_CONFIGURATION_ASSAULT..jpg","link":{"mp4":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt46bc8c9dc2698970/6333a4ee1a0b5e7d3d1ec4c5/OVERWATCH_WEBSITE_CHARACTER_CAPTURE_BastionConfiguration-Assault_WEB_16x9_1920x1080p30_H264.mp4","webm":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt96b6df4d081e3492/66798f5791d53b2446dc0615/OVERWATCH_WEBSITE_CHARACTER_CAPTURE_BastionConfiguration-Assault_WEB_16x9_1920x1080p30_H264.webm"}}},{"name":"설정: 수색","description":"이동하며 명중률이 높은 기관단총을 발사합니다.","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/9febc039b8d8f7743539e8743f78b15495e3ea619615ab763dc747acd29b9615.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaize